#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:25
msgid ""
"这些数字不能互相替代。修改文档或新增可选机制通常不改变配置 schema；改变 schema 意味着生产 validator/emitter "
"明确维护了新的格式，并更新策略断言与负测。策略不能 使尚未实现的 schema 获得支持。SDK manifest 增加一个被 file-map "
"覆盖的源码文件， 不等于修改 manifest 格式。"
msgstr ""
"These numbers are not interchangeable. Documentation edits or optional "
"mechanisms usually do not change configuration schemas. Schema changes mean "
"production validators/emitters explicitly maintain a new format, with "
"updated policy assertions and negative tests. Policy cannot grant support to"
" an unimplemented schema. Adding a file covered by the SDK manifest file-map"
" does not change the manifest format."

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:30
msgid "历史候选封存格式保留在其固定源码中；当前平台不提供候选封存或 legacy replay 入口。阅读原始报告不改变本次源码或产物的验收状态。"
msgstr ""
"Historical candidate sealing formats remain in their fixed source revisions;"
" the current platform exposes no candidate sealing or legacy replay entry "
"point. Reading original reports does not change acceptance of the current "
"source or artifacts."

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "类型化源码接口第 3 代只接受严格 TOML 解析后的不可变装配对象；生产 resolver、 factory 和 emitter 使用具名字段，不提供字典接口或 schema-1 JSON 装配兼容。 `resolved.json` 仍是第 1 版单向输出，用于审计和独立产物检查，不是可信配置入口。 `source_epoch` 当前为 3，是 Python 类级源码合同，不写入 JSON，也不增加 MCU 状态。维护工具直接观察实际 IR 类的声明，核对策略中的 typed IR 代际；公共 C factory 的源码代际也由同一策略校验。"
msgstr "Typed source interface generation 3 accepts only immutable assemblies produced by strict TOML parsing. Production resolvers, factories and emitters use named fields, without a mapping interface or schema-1 JSON assembly compatibility. `resolved.json` remains version-1 one-way output for auditing and independent artifact checks, not a trusted configuration input. `source_epoch` is currently 3: a Python class-level source contract that is not serialized to JSON and adds no MCU state. Maintenance tools observe the actual IR declaration and compare its typed IR generation with the policy; the same policy checks the public C factory source generation."

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "当前 `0.2.1` 用于开发与软件候选准备；版本值本身不表示已公开发行或已通过候选验收。 既有 `v0.2.0` 及其他标签保留原始源码身份，不移动标签。本轮公共 traits、独立 SDIO 请求及领域语义的破坏性源码迁移将 factory／source interface epoch 提升为 `3`。semantic version 仍是开发快照 `0.2.1`，exact 匹配和 authored schema `2` 不变。相同版本号不能让旧 epoch `1`／`2` SDK 通过当前代际检查，版本值也不把旧 SDK／候选资格转移到新源码。 新候选仍须独立绑定实际 clean source、配置、依赖、工具与执行证据。"
msgstr "The current `0.2.1` is for development and software-candidate preparation; its value does not establish public release or candidate acceptance. Existing `v0.2.0` and other tags retain their original source identities. This iteration raises the factory/source interface epoch to `3` for breaking source migrations of public traits, independent SDIO requests and domain semantics. The semantic version remains the `0.2.1` development snapshot; exact matching and authored schema `2` remain. A matching version cannot admit old epoch-`1`/`2` SDKs or transfer their qualification to new source. Each new candidate must independently bind its actual clean source, configuration, dependencies, tools and execution evidence."

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:44
msgid ""
"`0.1.0` 是 2026-10-15（Asia/Shanghai）首个公开源码 SDK 开发者预览版。 之前源码快照中的 `1.0.0` "
"是公开发行前的版本值；2026-01-12 第一阶段的旧 `0.1.0` 文字保留为历史里程碑。该已发布版本的范围和原始证据见 [0.1.0 "
"历史发行状态](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/status/release-0.1.0.md)，准确"
" source／tree 以其发行 manifest 为准。既有 tag、发行附件和证据保持原始身份，不随当前开发版本改写。"
msgstr ""
"`0.1.0` is the first public Source SDK developer preview, released on "
"2026-10-15 (Asia/Shanghai). The `1.0.0` in earlier source snapshots was a "
"pre-public-release version value; the earlier `0.1.0` wording from the first"
" phase on 2026-01-12 remains a historical milestone. See the [historical "
"0.1.0 release status](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/status/release-0.1.0.md)"
" for that release's scope and original evidence; its release manifest "
"defines the exact source/tree. Existing tags, release assets and evidence "
"retain their original identities and are not rewritten to match the current "
"development version."

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "factory 的 compact ID 只在该生成 bundle 内有意义。它返回既有静态 readonly face， 不分配、不初始化硬件。重新排序实例或改变配置可能改变 ID；不能把 ID 持久化后 拿到另一 bundle 使用。`factory_abi_epoch` 命名保留 ABI 字样，但目前只标记生成 源码接口代际：消费者、factory header、公共 face 和实现必须重新编译。当前 epoch 为 3；指定 0、旧值 1／2、未来值、非整数或找不到策略时必须拒绝，不能当成兼容 fallback。"
msgstr "Compact factory IDs are meaningful only within their generated bundle. A lookup returns an existing static readonly face without allocation or hardware initialization. Instance reordering or configuration changes may change IDs; do not persist an ID for another bundle. Although `factory_abi_epoch` retains ABI in its name, it marks generated source-interface generations: rebuild consumers, factory headers, public faces and implementations together. The current epoch is 3. Reject zero, old values 1/2, future values, nonintegers and missing policy rather than treating them as a compatibility fallback."

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:56
msgid ""
"生成配置须把策略原字节加入既有 inputs/snapshots/hash 闭包，并从唯一 loader 生成 "
"`NEXUS_PLATFORM_VERSION` 和 `NEXUS_FACTORY_ABI_EPOCH`。这些是编译期常量， 不会增加运行时 "
"registry、实例数量或 RAM。生产 emitter 与 SDK 打包注册完成后， 生成 header 校验和真实 SDK "
"消费才构成这条链路的完整验收；仅有维护工具不能代替 它们。历史 SDK 缺少该新策略，不被新工具自动认定为已维护代际。"
msgstr ""
"Generated configuration includes original policy bytes in the existing "
"inputs/snapshots/hash closure and derives `NEXUS_PLATFORM_VERSION` and "
"`NEXUS_FACTORY_ABI_EPOCH` through the sole loader. These compile-time "
"constants add no runtime registry, instance count or RAM. After production-"
"emitter and SDK-packager registration, generated-header checks and real SDK "
"consumption establish complete acceptance; maintenance tools alone cannot "
"replace them. Historical SDKs missing this policy are not automatically "
"recognized by new tools as maintained generations."

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "epoch 2 引入的 ADC 结果迁移"
msgstr "ADC result migration introduced by epoch 2"

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "epoch 2 已将 `nx_adc_group_request_t.frames` 改为显式 `output.frames`，并由 `results_kind` 区分 RAW 与 regular／injected paired 结果。原始字段访问必须迁移； 不保留 `frames` 影子、旧大小兼容或按运行态猜测结果布局。优先继续调用 `nx_adc_group_prepare()` 准备 raw 请求，由它设置 RAW discriminant；paired 结果使用 `nx_adc_group_prepare_results()`，请求、descriptor 与两个 span 共用一次借用生命周期。 直接读取 union 时必须先确认对应 `results_kind`，不能把 raw frame 指针当 descriptor。"
msgstr "Epoch 2 moved `nx_adc_group_request_t.frames` to explicit `output.frames`, with `results_kind` distinguishing RAW from paired regular/injected results. Migrate direct field access; there is no shadow `frames` field, old-size compatibility or runtime layout inference. Prefer `nx_adc_group_prepare()` for raw requests so it installs the RAW discriminant. Paired results use `nx_adc_group_prepare_results()`; request, descriptor and both spans share one borrow lifetime. Check `results_kind` before reading the union, and never interpret a raw frame pointer as a descriptor."

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "使用当前精确提交重新生成 bundle，并在同一配置和工具链下重新编译全部调用者、 公共 face／ops、factory、provider 和组件；不得混用 epoch 1 header、旧对象或缓存。 该结果合同在 epoch 3 保留；从 epoch 1 迁移的调用者仍须完成这一步。当前生成头、 SDK 及维护消费者只认可 epoch 3；旧 epoch 1／2 明确拒绝，不自动迁移、降级或以 `--development-fixture` 放宽接口检查。外部产品的迁移步骤见 [迁移指南](../guides/migration.md)。manifest schema 2 与 interface epoch 3 是独立字段。"
msgstr "Regenerate the bundle from the current exact commit and rebuild all callers, public faces/ops, factories, providers and components with one configuration and toolchain; do not mix epoch-1 headers, old objects or caches. The result contract remains in epoch 3, and consumers upgrading from epoch 1 must still perform this migration. Current generated headers, SDKs and maintained consumers accept only epoch 3 and reject epochs 1/2 without automatic migration, fallback or a `--development-fixture` exemption. See the [migration guide](../guides/migration.md). Manifest schema 2 and interface epoch 3 are independent fields."

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "epoch 3 的领域接口迁移"
msgstr "Domain-interface migration for epoch 3"

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "所选实例的只读 traits 类型归入公共 `nexus/io/traits.h`，factory 只生成具体常量与 查找。组件使用公共 `nx_uart_traits_t`、`nx_spi_traits_t` 等领域类型，不依赖生成器 专属的 `nx_factory_*_traits_t` typedef。通用 capability 改用 `nx_io_capability_t` 和 `NX_IO_CAP_*`；增强 SPI endpoint 使用 `nx_spi_transaction_traits_t`，I2C 的显式 provider profile 使用 `nx_i2c_limits_t`。生成 lookup 名称和所选 实例身份保持各自合同；查询仍不初始化硬件或授予运行资格。"
msgstr "Readonly trait types for selected instances now belong to public `nexus/io/traits.h`; factories generate only concrete constants and lookups. Components use domain types such as `nx_uart_traits_t` and `nx_spi_traits_t`, without generator-specific `nx_factory_*_traits_t` typedefs. Generic capabilities use `nx_io_capability_t` and `NX_IO_CAP_*`; enhanced SPI endpoints use `nx_spi_transaction_traits_t`, while explicit I2C provider profiles use `nx_i2c_limits_t`. Generated lookup names and selected instance identities retain their contracts. A query still neither initializes hardware nor grants runtime qualification."

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "SDIO function 请求直接持有 `base`、数据跨度和 function-local 地址，不再嵌套 `nx_block_request_t transfer`。将 `request.transfer.base` 等访问迁到直接字段，删除 无意义的 `first_block = 0`；不得将 SDIO 请求转为块设备请求。编码器模式、错误与 校验结果等变更按各领域公共声明迁移，不能根据旧数值或结构大小猜测含义。"
msgstr "SDIO function requests directly contain `base`, payload spans and a function-local address instead of nesting `nx_block_request_t transfer`. Move accesses such as `request.transfer.base` to the direct fields and remove meaningless `first_block = 0`; never cast an SDIO request to a block request. Migrate encoder modes, errors and checksum results against their domain declarations rather than guessing semantics from old numbers or structure sizes."

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "异步块请求使用 `nx_block_read_prepare()`／`nx_block_write_prepare()` 选择可写 RX／ 只读 TX。直接 `.data` 访问迁入所选 `buffer.rx`／`buffer.tx`，优先使用 prepare 和 `nx_block_request_data()`，不得仅翻转 `write` 标志后沿用另一 union 成员。"
msgstr "Asynchronous block requests use `nx_block_read_prepare()`/`nx_block_write_prepare()` to select writable RX or readonly TX. Migrate direct `.data` access to the selected `buffer.rx`/`buffer.tx`; prefer the prepare helpers and `nx_block_request_data()`. Never toggle only `write` while retaining the other union member."

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "I2C message 改用 `nx_i2c_message_write()`／`nx_i2c_message_read()` 构造只读 TX／ 可写 RX 视图，不再改 `read` 标志后继续使用旧指针成员。构造不准入、不建立 provider 借用； 提交后的借用合同不变。删除的 `i2c_long` 没有独立已维护引擎；统一 message 语法 仍须满足所选 provider 的显式限额，不代表 F4 自动接受超长事务。"
msgstr "Construct I2C messages with `nx_i2c_message_write()`/`nx_i2c_message_read()` for readonly TX or writable RX, instead of changing `read` while retaining the old pointer member. Construction neither admits a request nor establishes a provider loan; submission keeps the existing borrow contract. Removed `i2c_long` had no independently maintained engine. The unified message grammar must still satisfy explicit selected-provider limits; it does not make long F4 transactions automatically supported."

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "Flash 制造选项的 `brownout_level` 原始字段改为 `nx_flash_brownout_t brownout` 语义 profile。按公共具名常量选择预期供电范围，不复制 BOR 寄存器数字；该 profile 不声明实际触发电压或电源资格。零值 `NX_FLASH_BROWNOUT_UNKNOWN` 表示未选择， 在产生硬件作用前拒绝；禁用须显式选择具名值。普通读写接口不因此取得制造维护权限。"
msgstr "The raw Flash manufacturing option `brownout_level` becomes the semantic `nx_flash_brownout_t brownout` profile. Select the intended supply range using public named constants rather than copying BOR register numbers. The profile does not state an actual trip voltage or power qualification. Zero `NX_FLASH_BROWNOUT_UNKNOWN` means unset and is rejected before hardware effects; disabling requires an explicit named choice. Ordinary read/write access does not grant manufacturing-maintenance authority."

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "其他直接访问按以下领域语义迁移；公共头仍是完整字段与调用合同权威。"
msgstr "Migrate other direct accesses using the following domain semantics. Public headers remain authoritative for complete fields and call contracts."

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "旧访问或假设"
msgstr "Old access or assumption"

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "epoch 3 迁移动作"
msgstr "Epoch-3 migration action"

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "公共 `nx_uart_wire_config_t` 与 PSC／guard 编码"
msgstr "Public `nx_uart_wire_config_t` and PSC/guard encodings"

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "冷态设置改为 F4 私有 `nx_stm32_uart_wire_config_t`；公共模式与 LIN 请求保持领域接口，专家配置不作为通用时间 API。"
msgstr "Cold settings use private F4 `nx_stm32_uart_wire_config_t`; public modes and LIN requests retain domain interfaces. Expert configuration is not a generic timing API."

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "EXTI event 与红外 decoder 的物理 `line`"
msgstr "Physical `line` in EXTI events and infrared decoders"

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "每个消费者绑定独立事件源；decoder 不再按物理线号筛选，合并事件流前按来源路由。"
msgstr "Bind each consumer to an independent event source. Decoders no longer filter by physical line; route by origin before merging event streams."

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "CAN 物理 `fifo`／`filter` 与原始错误数值"
msgstr "Physical CAN `fifo`/`filter` and raw error numbers"

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "使用逻辑 `filter_tag`、`NX_CAN_FILTER_UNKNOWN` 与 `nx_can_protocol_error_t`，不按物理过滤器号执行产品策略。"
msgstr "Use logical `filter_tag`, `NX_CAN_FILTER_UNKNOWN` and `nx_can_protocol_error_t`. Do not implement product policy using physical filter numbers."

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "Ethernet 原始 descriptor checksum 位"
msgstr "Raw Ethernet descriptor checksum bits"

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "使用 `CHECKED` 与对应错误／协议标签；`AVAILABLE` 单独存在不证明校验成功。"
msgstr "Use `CHECKED` and corresponding error/protocol tags; `AVAILABLE` alone does not establish checksum success."

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "USB Host 的物理 channel 编号"
msgstr "Physical USB Host channel numbers"

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "使用装配内逻辑 `nx_usb_host_pipe_id_t`；物理通道映射留 provider，不将 pipe ID 持久化跨装配使用。"
msgstr "Use assembly-local logical `nx_usb_host_pipe_id_t`. Provider owns the physical channel mapping; do not persist pipe IDs for another assembly."

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "ADC 采样码表与 DAC 的 `digital_output12`"
msgstr "ADC sampling-code tables and DAC `digital_output12`"

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "ADC 使用 `scan_ticks / ticks_per_second` 的名义整扫描转换时长；DAC 使用所选写入单位的 `output_codes` 和 `code_bits`，不将数字码当电压。"
msgstr "ADC uses nominal complete-scan conversion duration `scan_ticks / ticks_per_second`. DAC uses `output_codes` and `code_bits` in the selected write unit; digital codes are not voltages."

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "NAND 原始 status byte 与未标注 ECC 数值"
msgstr "Raw NAND status bytes and unlabelled ECC values"

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "使用 `nx_nand_status_t` 与 `nx_nand_ecc_format_t`；raw ECC 身份不提供解码、纠错或 OOB 策略。"
msgstr "Use `nx_nand_status_t` and `nx_nand_ecc_format_t`. A raw ECC identity supplies no decoder, correction or OOB policy."

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "Encoder TI 输入名与滤波编码"
msgstr "Encoder TI input names and filter codes"

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "使用逻辑 A／B 模式及滤波采样事实，不把它们当成精确机械消抖保证。"
msgstr "Use logical A/B modes and filter sampling facts without interpreting them as exact mechanical debounce guarantees."

#: docs/design/source-compatibility.md:0
msgid "使用同一精确提交重新生成配置和 factory，并重编所有调用者、provider、组件与 SDK 消费者。TOML schema 2、typed IR 源码代际 3、resolved projection 1 和 SDK manifest 2 保持各自原合同；源码代际提升不自动扩大芯片、模式或实板支持。"
msgstr "Regenerate configuration and factory from one exact commit, then rebuild every caller, provider, component and SDK consumer. TOML schema 2, typed IR source generation 3, resolved projection 1 and SDK manifest 2 retain their respective contracts. Raising a source generation does not automatically extend chip, mode or physical support."

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:62
msgid "自动检查"
msgstr "Automatic checks"

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:74
msgid ""
"`--generated` 使用实际生成 header 的路径；不同构建根的路径可能不同。工具从真实 Python "
"validators/emission 的 AST 读取 schema，读取实际事实文件，并运行现有 "
"`NexusConfigVersion.cmake.in` 的相等版本、不同版本与 range 拒绝用例。它不复制 resolver 选择规则；如果 "
"authority 的表达形式改变，检查会明确失败，维护者需 更新观察器。所有参与字节有 SHA/size，结束前复验，观察过程中变化不能报告一致。"
msgstr ""
"`--generated` takes the actual generated-header path, which may differ "
"between build roots. The tool reads schemas from real Python "
"validator/emitter ASTs, reads actual fact files, and executes existing "
"`NexusConfigVersion.cmake.in` equal-version, different-version and range-"
"rejection cases. It does not copy resolver selection rules; authority-"
"expression changes fail explicitly and require observer maintenance. All "
"participating bytes have SHA/size and are rechecked before return; "
"concurrent changes cannot report consistency."

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:80
msgid ""
"`--sdk` 复用既有 `package_source_sdk.verify` 校验整个源文件映射、依赖、厂商 import 和 package "
"exports，再检查策略及 schema/version 一致。`consistent` 只表示这些 元数据一致，不表示 fresh "
"全量测试、软件候选、签名、物理 HIL 或产品发布通过。"
msgstr ""
"`--sdk` reuses existing `package_source_sdk.verify` to check the entire "
"source file map, dependencies, vendor imports and package exports, then "
"policy/schema/version consistency. `consistent` means this metadata agrees, "
"not that fresh full tests, software candidates, signatures, physical HIL or "
"product releases pass."

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:84
msgid ""
"版本变更需先写拒绝/兼容契约测试，再修改唯一策略及实际 authority。source breaking 变更需明确 major/epoch "
"的变化和外部迁移；可选源码能力用 minor，保持公开合同的 缺陷修复用 patch。没有实际迁移实现时，禁止接受旧格式后静默选择新行为。"
msgstr ""
"Version changes first add rejection/compatibility contract tests, then "
"modify the single policy and actual authorities. Source-breaking changes "
"require explicit major/epoch changes and external migration; optional source"
" capabilities use minor and public-contract-preserving fixes use patch. "
"Without real migration, accepting old formats then silently selecting new "
"behavior is prohibited."

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:88
msgid "依赖来源、获取与选版"
msgstr "Dependency provenance, retrieval and version selection"

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:90
msgid ""
"`tools/maintenance/source_catalogue.py` 是已审 Git 依赖目录：`upstream_url` "
"标识官方来源与版本观察地址，`fetch_url` 标识本提交允许的获取地址，Gitlink 选择 实际 "
"commit。源码锁继续约束官方来源、许可和内容；锁中的 commit 必须与 Gitlink 相等，不能覆盖它。更换托管地址不意味着升级库或改变 "
"CMake 依赖图。"
msgstr ""
"`tools/maintenance/source_catalogue.py` is the reviewed Git dependency "
"catalogue: `upstream_url` identifies the official source and version-"
"observation endpoint, `fetch_url` identifies the retrieval location approved"
" by this commit, and the Gitlink selects the actual commit. Source locks "
"continue to constrain official provenance, licenses and content; a locked "
"commit must equal the Gitlink rather than override it. Changing hosting does"
" not upgrade a library or change the CMake dependency graph."

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:95
msgid ""
"目录明确枚举顶层 Git 子模块及其嵌套子模块。所选提交的运行时依赖 及其递归闭包参与源码 SDK；GoogleTest/GoogleMock "
"只供主机测试使用。嵌套模块的 section name 和相对路径分别核对，不能假设两者相同。GD32 官方归档继续按已审 "
"子树、逐文件锁和原许可管理，不伪装成官方 Git 仓库的 fork。"
msgstr ""
"The catalogue explicitly enumerates top-level Git submodules and their "
"nested submodules. The source SDK includes the selected commit's runtime "
"dependencies and their recursive closure; GoogleTest/GoogleMock are used "
"only for host tests. A nested module's section name and relative path are "
"checked separately and cannot be assumed identical. Official GD32 archives "
"remain governed by reviewed subtrees, per-file locks and original licenses; "
"they are not represented as forks of official Git repositories."

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:100
msgid ""
"`X-Gen-Lab` 托管目录中声明的官方 Git 依赖 fork；`fetch_url` 与 `.gitmodules` "
"指向已验证的组织仓库。获取地址使用目录中的实际仓库名，不从磁盘 路径或上游 URL 推导名称。官方 `upstream_url` "
"保留来源与版本观察职责，Gitlink 继续选择准确 commit。每个 Nexus 提交只认可一个明确获取地址，不使用全局 "
"`url.insteadOf`、浮动分支或自动回退到其他仓库。"
msgstr ""
"`X-Gen-Lab` hosts the forks of official Git dependencies declared in the "
"catalogue; `fetch_url` and `.gitmodules` point to verified organization "
"repositories. Fetch URLs use the actual repository names in the catalogue, "
"not names inferred from disk paths or upstream URLs. The official "
"`upstream_url` retains its role for provenance and version observation, "
"while the Gitlink continues to select the exact commit. Each Nexus commit "
"permits one explicit fetch URL, without global `url.insteadOf`, floating "
"branches or automatic fallback to another repository."

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:106
msgid ""
"FreeRTOS 使用仅修改根 `.gitmodules` 中两个已知 URL 的组织提交，集成引用为 "
"`nexus/transport-v11.1.0-r1`。它的唯一父提交是已锁定官方基线，嵌套 Gitlink、源码、 "
"许可和文件模式保持原样。`dependencies/freertos-transport.lock.json` 与 "
"`dependencies/reviews/freertos/` 中的基线文件和补丁记录该审查；补丁不在配置或构建 期间动态应用。官方发行 tag "
"仍指向官方基线，组织提交不代表新的官方发行版。"
msgstr ""
"FreeRTOS uses an organization commit that changes only two known URLs in its"
" root `.gitmodules`, with integration ref `nexus/transport-v11.1.0-r1`. Its "
"sole parent is the locked official baseline; nested Gitlinks, source code, "
"licenses and file modes remain unchanged. `dependencies/freertos-"
"transport.lock.json` and the baseline file and patch under "
"`dependencies/reviews/freertos/` record this review; the patch is never "
"applied dynamically during configuration or builds. Official release tags "
"still identify the official baseline. The organization commit does not "
"represent a new official release."

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:112
msgid ""
"开发 checkout 与 SDK 打包执行实际 Git 父链、完整树差异和两处 URL 替换检查， 不能只信锁文件声明的 "
"`changed_paths`。SDK 内的审查材料和文件映射验证导出字节， 无 Git "
"的消费环境不能据此声称重新验证了完整父链或源码树。消费者须先通过独立 可信的发行身份、候选记录或预先批准的归档摘要确认 SDK，再执行包内 "
"Python/CMake。 包内自带 manifest 与内容一致，本身不证明来源可信，也不等于签名验证。"
msgstr ""
"Development checkouts and SDK packaging verify the actual Git parent chain, "
"complete tree difference and two URL replacements, rather than trusting the "
"lock's declared `changed_paths`. Review material and file maps in the SDK "
"verify exported bytes; consumers without Git cannot claim to have reverified"
" the complete parent chain or source tree. Consumers must first establish "
"SDK identity through an independently trusted release identity, candidate "
"record or previously approved archive digest, before executing packaged "
"Python/CMake. Agreement between a self-contained manifest and its payload "
"does not itself establish trusted provenance or signature verification."

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:118
msgid "托管迁移、同步与恢复"
msgstr "Hosting migration, synchronization and recovery"

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:120
msgid ""
"迁移先验证 fork 的官方父仓库关系、匿名读取、固定 commit 与所需引用可达，再 更新 Nexus 获取策略。组织仓库为受维护提交保留 "
"`refs/tags/nexus/pins/<完整SHA>`； 联网准备在改动 checkout 前核对引用返回的对象与所选 SHA。FreeRTOS "
"同时保留官方 基线和组织集成提交。仓库或引用存在不代表当前连接能写入它，也不代表分支或 tag "
"保护已经启用；这些状态需实际读回。生产源码和已发布引用不得因同步上游而被重写。"
msgstr ""
"Before changing Nexus retrieval policy, migration verifies the fork's "
"official parent relationship, anonymous reads, and reachability of fixed "
"commits and required refs. Organization repositories retain "
"`refs/tags/nexus/pins/<full-SHA>` for maintained commits; network-enabled "
"preparation checks that the ref advertises the selected SHA before changing "
"the checkout. FreeRTOS retains both the official baseline and the "
"organization integration commit. Repository or ref existence does not "
"establish that the current connection can write to it, or that branch or tag"
" protection is enabled; those states require actual readback. Synchronizing "
"upstream must not rewrite production source or published refs."

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:126
msgid ""
"已有 checkout 从已审官方地址迁往已审组织地址时，准备工具先检查工作区、实际 仓库根、origin 和允许的旧/新 "
"commit。普通源码修改、未跟踪依赖文件、未知 origin 或未知 HEAD 都应停止处理。已登记的旧 Gitlink 可以作为迁移起点；不能将一次"
" 正常的子模块版本切换误判为用户源码修改。工具不 stash、reset、clean 或强制更新。"
msgstr ""
"When an existing checkout migrates from a reviewed official location to a "
"reviewed organization location, preparation first checks the worktree, "
"actual repository root, origin, and allowed old/new commits. Ordinary source"
" edits, untracked dependency files, an unknown origin or an unknown HEAD "
"must stop preparation. A registered old Gitlink is an admissible migration "
"starting point; a normal submodule revision transition must not be "
"misclassified as a user source edit. The tool does not stash, reset, clean "
"or force updates."

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:131
msgid ""
"已有 checkout 先切换到要消费的准确 Nexus 提交，再从仓库根运行显式准备入口。 "
"工具按所选提交识别已登记的旧依赖状态；以下命令允许下载，离线检查省略 `--allow-network`："
msgstr ""
"For an existing checkout, first select the exact Nexus commit to consume, "
"then run explicit preparation from the repository root. The tool recognizes "
"registered old dependency state according to that selected commit. These "
"commands permit downloads; omit `--allow-network` for offline verification:"

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:140
msgid ""
"准备工具先审查源码拥有的完整声明和 Gitlink，再同步、初始化明确选中的顶层路径。 每个父模块更新后，重新审查其实际声明和所属 Git "
"树，再逐层处理明确选中的子路径。 这些步骤不使用无范围的递归下载；组织维护分支只声明已选择并审查的依赖。 先更新顶层 "
"FreeRTOS，再同步它的嵌套声明，避免旧 `.gitmodules` 把官方地址写回。 成功后逐项核对路径、Gitlink、实际 "
"HEAD、origin 和干净状态。缺失对象、下载 失败或来源不符必须失败，保留实际执行记录，不改用 `--remote` 或隐式备用地址。 "
"配置、构建和提交门禁均不自动联网准备依赖。"
msgstr ""
"The preparation tool first audits the complete source-owned declarations and"
" Gitlinks, then synchronizes and initializes the explicitly selected top-"
"level paths. After each parent module is updated, it audits that parent's "
"actual declarations and owning Git tree again, then processes the explicitly"
" selected child paths one level at a time. These steps do not perform "
"unscoped recursive downloads; organization-maintained branches declare only "
"dependencies that are selected and reviewed. Update top-level FreeRTOS "
"before synchronizing its nested declarations, so its old `.gitmodules` "
"cannot write official URLs back. On completion, check each path, Gitlink, "
"actual HEAD, origin and clean state. Missing objects, failed downloads or a "
"provenance mismatch must fail and retain actual execution records; do not "
"substitute `--remote` or an implicit alternate location. Configuration, "
"builds and commit gates never prepare dependencies through implicit network "
"access."

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:148
msgid ""
"回滚使用正常的新提交，一起恢复获取策略、Gitlink、审查锁和相应示例 pin；不改写 旧提交、tag 或证据。fork 不等于备份：Nexus "
"自身的 Git bundle 不包含子模块对象， 需要另存依赖 Git 对象，或保留可验证的完整源码 SDK，并实际验证异地恢复。服务 "
"不可用时消费已批准的离线包，不把临时换源隐藏在普通构建中。"
msgstr ""
"Rollback uses a normal new commit to restore retrieval policy, Gitlinks, "
"review locks and corresponding example pins together; it does not rewrite "
"old commits, tags or evidence. A fork is not a backup: a Nexus Git bundle "
"does not contain submodule objects. Retain dependency Git objects "
"separately, or keep a verifiable complete source SDK, and actually verify "
"recovery on another host. During a service outage, consume an approved "
"offline package rather than hiding a temporary source change inside a normal"
" build."

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:153
msgid "Codex 的每周依赖流程"
msgstr "Codex weekly dependency process"

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:155
msgid ""
"`tools/maintenance/dependency_proposals.py` 默认只观察当前实际 Gitlink、锁、归档和 "
"许可证字节，网络读取为零。它覆盖 FreeRTOS、CMSIS、STM32 CMSIS、GD32 import、 GoogleTest、ARM "
"工具链、开发环境/Python 工具锁和 GitHub Actions 的确切 pins。 某项发行物还需审查许可证时，会明确记录 "
"required，不从版本名猜许可。"
msgstr ""
"`tools/maintenance/dependency_proposals.py` defaults to observing actual "
"Gitlinks, locks, archives and license bytes with zero network reads. It "
"covers exact FreeRTOS, CMSIS, STM32 CMSIS, GD32 import, GoogleTest, ARM-"
"toolchain, development/Python-tool and GitHub Actions pins. Releases needing"
" license review explicitly record required rather than inferring licenses "
"from version names."

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:168
msgid ""
"显式 upstream 模式只查询目录中官方 `upstream_url` 的 heads/tags，组织 fork 的 `fetch_url` "
"不替代版本来源。普通依赖的 `upstream_revision` 等于所选 Gitlink； FreeRTOS 地址迁移提交分别记录 "
"`selected_revision` 与官方 `upstream_base`， "
"避免把组织提交误判为官方缺失版本。真正升级官方基线后，新的组织集成提交也必须 重新准备并审查。使用无 shell、禁止 credential "
"helper/交互/global config 的 `git ls-remote`；每个请求最长 10 秒， stdout/stderr 总捕获上限 1"
" MiB，refs 最多 8192 条。复用已有有界 subprocess capture/kill/reap 机制，不执行 HIL admission"
" 或设备动作。输出目录必须新建且无 symlink；源码内只允许 build 目录。原始 stream、argv、实际退出码、时间和工具/ 响应 SHA"
" 均保留。网络、超时、输出或格式失败为 `not_observed`；没有 Git publication 的 "
"GD32/工具链/环境项需单独审查发行来源，不能伪造版本观察成功。观察 refs 不是 选择最新可靠版本或批准升级。周度 workflow "
"的实际运行状态需另看 GitHub 证据。"
msgstr ""
"Explicit upstream mode queries heads/tags only from the catalogue's official"
" `upstream_url`; an organization fork's `fetch_url` does not replace the "
"version source. For ordinary dependencies, `upstream_revision` equals the "
"selected Gitlink. A FreeRTOS URL-migration commit records "
"`selected_revision` separately from its official `upstream_base`, avoiding a"
" false report that the organization commit is missing upstream. After an "
"actual official-baseline upgrade, a new organization integration commit must"
" also be prepared and reviewed. The tool invokes `git ls-remote` without a "
"shell, credential helpers, interaction or global configuration. Each request"
" is limited to 10 seconds, 1 MiB of combined stdout/stderr capture and 8192 "
"refs. It reuses the existing bounded subprocess capture/kill/reap mechanism "
"and performs no HIL admission or device actions. The output directory must "
"be new and free of symlinks; within the source tree, only build directories "
"are allowed. Original streams, argv, actual exit codes, timings and "
"tool/response hashes are retained. Network, timeout, output or format "
"failures remain `not_observed`. GD32/toolchain/environment entries without "
"Git publication need separate release-source review; successful version "
"observation must not be fabricated. Observing refs neither selects the "
"newest reliable version nor approves an upgrade. Actual weekly workflow "
"execution requires separate GitHub evidence."

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:181
msgid ""
"candidate plan 使用严格 JSON：`schema_version=1`、已观察的 `dependency`、明确 "
"`proposed_revision`、不带凭据/query 的公共 HTTPS `source_url`、实际非空 archive "
"identity、声明的 license expression 和 notices identities，以及可选的 `evidence` 映射。每个 "
"identity 都是绝对 `path`、完整 `sha256` 和真实 `size`。Git 来源必须是 完整 40 位 commit，不能用 "
"main/latest；license 内容必须独立审查，声明不是许可 批准。archive 是否来自该 commit、是否完整包含声明 notice "
"和所有变更也在独立 来源/许可证 review 中验证，工具不会从任意用户提供的 notice 推断这些事实。"
msgstr ""
"Candidate plans use strict JSON: `schema_version=1`, observed `dependency`, "
"explicit `proposed_revision`, public HTTPS `source_url` without "
"credentials/query, actual nonempty archive identity, declared license "
"expression and notices identities, and optional `evidence` mapping. Each "
"identity includes absolute `path`, full `sha256` and actual `size`. Git "
"provenance needs a full 40-character commit, never main/latest. License "
"content needs independent review; declarations are not approval. Independent"
" provenance/license review also checks whether archives match commits and "
"completely contain notices and changes; tools infer none of these facts from"
" arbitrary user-provided notices."

